  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{吐|は}く (to exhale/vomit X).\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates ongoing action. {吐|は}いて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'is exhaling/vomiting.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{息|いき}→息：02176_iki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{吐|は}く (to exhale)\n- {吐|は}きそう (feels like vomiting)\n- ⟦{嘘|うそ}→嘘：01796_uso⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{吐|は}く (to tell a lie)\n- ⟦{弱音|よわね}→弱音：17446_yowane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{吐|は}く (to complain, show weakness)\n- ⟦{本音|ほんね}→本音：06620_honne⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{吐|は}く (to reveal true feelings)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {吐|は}く - to exhale/spit out\n- ⟦{吸|す}う→吸う：04394_suu⟧ - to inhale/suck in\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{嘘|うそ}→嘘：01796_uso⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{吐|は}く (to lie)\n- ⟦{弱音|よわね}→弱音：17446_yowane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{吐|は}く (to whine, complain)\n- ⟦{本音|ほんね}→本音：06620_honne⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{吐|は}く (to speak honestly)",
